  "body": "## Wallpaper Reactor 0.29.0\n\n_Changes since 0.28.1_\n\n## Highlights\n\n### All platforms\n\n- Wallpaper Reactor is rebuilt from the ground up: one app on every platform, with a faster engine underneath\n\n### Linux\n\n- Wallpaper Reactor now runs on KDE Plasma 6, as a .deb or a Flatpak\n\n## Before you update\n\n### Windows\n\n- Before uninstalling the Microsoft Store version, choose Stop wallpaper so your own desktop picture comes back\n\n## Features\n\n### All platforms\n\n- Interactive 3D wallpapers you can touch and play\n- Navigate the whole app with a game controller\n- Downloaded wallpapers update themselves\n- Video, shader and 3D wallpapers use less memory and battery\n- Wallpapers with many files download much faster\n- Browse previews animate only while they are on screen, which saves battery\n- Browse previews are ready before they scroll into view\n- Wallpaper cards have a ⋯ menu to favorite, preview or set a wallpaper\n- Removing a favorite now stays removed on all your devices\n- Convert a video for a wallpaper inside the app, with loop modes and a time estimate\n- Choose your own image for a shader wallpaper, such as Matrix Rain\n- Wallpaper Reactor now runs in your browser at web.wallpaperreactor.app\n- Attach your logs when you send feedback\n- Wallpaper links you open or share can open straight in the app\n\n### Android\n\n- A Download wallpaper updates setting chooses whether updates download automatically\n\n## Downloads\n\n| Platform | Get it |\n| --- | --- |\n| Android | [Google Play](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.wallpaperreactor) · [APK](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/v0.29.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.29.0-android.apk) |\n| Windows | [Microsoft Store](https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9N4302CRDQRL) · [Installer (.exe)](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/v0.29.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.29.0-windows-x64-setup.exe) · [.msi](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/v0.29.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.29.0-windows-x64.msi) |\n| macOS | [Mac App Store](https://apps.apple.com/us/app/wallpaper-reactor-lite/id6751447022) · [.dmg](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/v0.29.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.29.0-macos-universal.dmg) |\n| Linux (KDE Plasma 6) | [.deb](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/v0.29.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.29.0-linux-amd64.deb) · [Flatpak](https://github.com/wallpaper-reactor/wallpaper-reactor-website/releases/download/v0.29.0/wallpaper-reactor-v0.29.0-linux-amd64.flatpak) |\n"
